msgstr ""
"Who is who, between the two instances. This table is yours: the peer presents an email, it never designates an account here.\n"
"                                <br/>A received message whose author carries this email is written under the <b>contact</b>'s name. With no row, it carries the name of the peer's organisation.\n"
"                                <br/>A task the peer addresses to this email is assigned to the <b>account</b>. With no account here, the contact provides one if it has exactly one, internal and active; otherwise the task is left with the fallback person, with a note saying who it was addressed to."

